    {
      "title": "Modules: The Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Modules: The Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. A Module Is a File",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Own scope: top-level variables are ==private== unless exported",
                "Evaluated ==once==, then cached",
                "{blue:CJS}: `require()` + `module.exports`, synchronous, runtime; default `.js` in Node",
                "{green:ESM}: static `import`/`export`, parsed before any code runs; browsers + Node"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. CJS vs ESM",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "CJS",
                "ESM"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Loading",
                  "dynamic, synchronous",
                  "static, async-capable"
                ],
                [
                  "Exports",
                  "value copies",
                  "==live bindings=="
                ],
                [
                  "Mode",
                  "sloppy by default",
                  "strict always"
                ],
                [
                  "Globals",
                  "`require`, `__dirname`, `__filename`",
                  "none of these"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Parse",
                    "sub": "find imports",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Link",
                    "sub": "wire bindings",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Evaluate",
                    "sub": "run once",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Tree-shake ESM but not CJS?** ESM imports are static, so unused exports are known before running",
                "**Static analysis?** Reading imports and exports from syntax alone, without executing code",
                "**Evaluated once?** The cache is keyed by resolved path, so side effects and state are shared"
              ],
              "style": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "`require` is a runtime call, so tools cannot know what it loads. `import` is ==syntax==, so they can."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Import and Export Forms",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Import and Export Forms",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Named, default, namespace",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Default==: one per module, imported under any name",
                "Namespace object is ==read-only=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Form",
                "Export",
                "Import"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Named",
                  "`export const a = 1`",
                  "`import { a, f } from './m.js'`"
                ],
                [
                  "Default",
                  "`export default expr`",
                  "`import Foo from './m.js'`"
                ],
                [
                  "Namespace",
                  "none",
                  "`import * as ns from './m.js'`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Rename, re-export, side effects",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`export *` re-exports every named export, ==skips default==",
                "`import './setup.js'` ==runs the module only==",
                "Default and named together: default first, braces after"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "javascript",
              "lines": [
                "export { a as b }",
                "export { a } from './m.js'",
                "export * from './m.js'",
                "import './setup.js'",
                "import d, { n as m } from './m.js'"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Common mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`import { x } from './m'` fails in Node ESM: ==extension required==",
                "Braces mean named, no braces mean default",
                "Braces on a default export: SyntaxError"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Named vs default",
              "text": "Named: one fixed name, easier tree shaking. Default: importers pick any name, so names drift."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Live Bindings and Dynamic Import",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Live Bindings and Dynamic Import",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Live vs Snapshot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Live binding==: import = **read-only view** of exporter's variable",
                "Importer assigning to it → {red:TypeError}"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "ESM",
                "CJS"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Exports",
                  "live view",
                  "value copy"
                ],
                [
                  "Later change",
                  "visible",
                  "stale"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. import() and Top-Level await",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`import()` returns a ==Promise== of the module namespace",
                "Usable inside `if` or functions: **lazy loading**, code splitting",
                "==Top-level await==: ESM only; blocks importers until settled"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "javascript",
              "lines": [
                "if (needsChart) {",
                "  const m = await import('./chart.js');",
                "  m.draw();",
                "}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Circular Imports",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "{blue:ESM}: uninitialised binding → TDZ {red:ReferenceError}",
                "{purple:CJS}: partially filled `exports` object",
                "Fix: restructure, or access **lazily** inside functions"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Live binding; can importer assign?** Live view of exporter's variable; assigning throws.",
                "**import() vs import?** Runtime Promise, conditional; statements are static.",
                "**Circular ESM vs CJS?** ESM: TDZ error; CJS: partial exports."
              ],
              "style": "check"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Node Interop and package.json type",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Node Interop and package.json type",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. How Node Picks the Type",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "File",
                "Treated as"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`.mjs`",
                  "==ESM== always"
                ],
                [
                  "`.cjs`",
                  "==CJS== always"
                ],
                [
                  "`.js` + `\"type\": \"module\"`",
                  "ESM"
                ],
                [
                  "`.js` + `\"commonjs\"` or none",
                  "CJS (default)"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Nearest package.json== decides `.js`",
                "Node 22.7+/20.19+ sniff ESM syntax when no type; set `type` anyway"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Crossing Over and exports",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "ESM imports CJS: `module.exports` = ==default import==",
                "Older Node: `require(esm)` throws ==ERR_REQUIRE_ESM==",
                "22.12+/20.19+: sync ESM works; top-level await throws `ERR_REQUIRE_ASYNC_MODULE`",
                "Portable: `await import()` from CJS",
                "`exports` = ==public entry points==",
                "`import`/`require` conditions serve dual packages",
                "`main` = legacy fallback"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "json",
              "lines": [
                "\"exports\": {",
                "  \".\": {",
                "    \"import\": \"./index.mjs\",",
                "    \"require\": \"./index.cjs\"",
                "  }",
                "},",
                "\"main\": \"./index.cjs\""
              ],
              "note": "dual package"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistakes and Interview Point",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`Cannot use import statement`: ESM in a CJS file; set type or use `.mjs`",
                "`require is not defined`: CJS in an ESM file; use `.cjs` or import",
                "No `__dirname` in ESM: use `import.meta.dirname` or `import.meta.url`"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**ESM?** `.mjs`, or `.js` under type module",
                "**ESM from CJS?** `await import()`",
                "**exports?** Public entry points, conditions"
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
