            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Tree Shaking and sideEffects",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Tree shaking drops ==unused exports==",
                "Needs **static ESM** syntax",
                "{red:CJS} and dynamic `require` defeat it",
                "`\"sideEffects\": false` = unused modules are safe to remove",
                "An array lists files to keep: CSS, polyfills"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "json",
              "lines": [
                "{",
                "  \"sideEffects\": [\"*.css\", \"./src/polyfill.js\"]",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "package.json"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. npm Scripts",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Command",
                "Rule"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`npm run build`",
                  "needs `run`"
                ],
                [
                  "`npm start`, `npm test`",
                  "no `run`"
                ],
                [
                  "`prebuild`, `postbuild`",
                  "run automatically"
